{%- comment -%}
===============================================================================
  Turn2Opinion — email system v1 ("the conversation")
  -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
  Template   : T2. Guardian invitation (Yes / No)
  File       : minor.liquid
  Class      : Parent / guardian (transactional — no unsubscribe)
  Trigger    : A Teen registers and names this guardian
  Tone       : violet
  Replaces   : minor.liquid

  SUBJECT LINES — pick one, or A/B them
    1. {{ user.name.first }} would like to join the Turn2Opinion Teen panel
    2. Your decision is needed: {{ user.name.first }}’s Teen registration
    3. Please choose Yes or No for {{ user.name.first }}

  PREHEADER
    {{ user.name.first }} asked to join the Turn2Opinion Teen panel. Please choose Yes or No.

  PRIMARY CTA
    YES / NO  ->  links.yes / links.no

  PLAIN-TEXT ALTERNATIVE
    dist/text/minor.txt — send as the text/plain part of a multipart message.
    HTML-only mail is scored down by most spam filters.

  Generated from react/src/emails/teen-set.jsx — edit the JSX and re-run
  `npm run build`. Hand edits to this file are overwritten.

  Images are served from the base configured at build time; upload assets/
  there before sending. Serve over HTTPS from a stable path — clients do not
  retry a 404, so a moved asset breaks every copy already delivered.
===============================================================================
{%- endcomment -%}
{%- comment -%} Parent consent links (issue #44): the backend sends links.open / yes / no. When it only sends the
  one-time code (otp.code + otp.sig), build the same current /parent-consent/ URL here, so the buttons always work. {%- endcomment -%}
{%- if site -%}{%- assign consent_site = site -%}{%- else -%}{%- assign consent_site = 'https://' | append: user.origin -%}{%- endif -%}
{%- capture consent_base -%}{{ consent_site }}/parent-consent/?user={{ user._id }}&amp;code={{ otp.code }}&amp;s={{ otp.sig }}{%- endcapture -%}
{%- if links.open -%}{%- assign consent_open = links.open -%}{%- else -%}{%- assign consent_open = consent_base -%}{%- endif -%}
{%- if links.yes -%}{%- assign consent_yes = links.yes -%}{%- else -%}{%- assign consent_yes = consent_base | append: '&amp;d=yes' -%}{%- endif -%}
{%- if links.no -%}{%- assign consent_no = links.no -%}{%- else -%}{%- assign consent_no = consent_base | append: '&amp;d=no' -%}{%- endif -%}
